v class=\"faint-form\">No.<br>Date</div>\n\n    <div class=\"title\">§ 4.3 体内物质的运输</div>\n\n    <div class=\"circulation\">\n      <div class=\"label\">血液循环系统</div>\n      <div class=\"brace\">{</div>\n      <div class=\"brace-items\">\n        <span>血液</span>\n        <span>心脏</span>\n        <span>血管</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-one\">一、血液（约占体重的7%～8%）</div>\n\n    <div class=\"blood-layout\">\n      <div class=\"blood-word\">1. 血液</div>\n      <div class=\"small-brace\">{</div>\n\n      <div class=\"plasma\">血浆（55%）</div>\n      <div class=\"plasma-detail\">水、无机盐、葡萄糖、蛋白质等</div>\n      <div class=\"plasma-note blue\">运输血细胞，运输养料和废物</div>\n\n      <div class=\"cells\">血细胞（45%）</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-brace\">{</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-types\">\n        <span>红细胞</span>\n        <span>白细胞</span>\n        <span>血小板</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"loss-note\">一次失血超过体内血量的 <span class=\"blue\">30%</span>，就会危及生命</div>\n\n    <section class=\"block redcells\">\n      <div class=\"line heading\">2. 红细胞　(1)特点、没有细胞核，呈两面凹的圆盘状　<span class=\"blue\">增加表面积，易携氧</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">(2)数量　正常男性平均为 500万个/mm<sup>3</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2\">正常女性平均为 420万个/mm<sup>3</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">(3)功能　<span class=\"blue\">运输氧和部分二氧化碳</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1 smaller\">(4)血红蛋白的特点　在氧浓度高的地方容易和氧结合，在氧浓度低的地方容易与氧分离</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"block whitecells\">\n      <div class=\"line heading\">3. 白细胞　(1)特点　数量少，有细胞核，体积比红细胞大</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">(2)数量　一般在 4000－10000个/mm<sup>3</sup> 正常范围内波动</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">(3)功能　<span class=\"blue\">吞噬病菌，人体内的卫士，保护人体免受感染</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1 smaller\">(4)功能？？？　<span class=\"blue\">机体防御和保护功能</span>　主要是能做变形运动和吞噬运动，并有防御功能</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent3 smaller\">（数量少[与红细胞数量比约为1∶600]但种类多）</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"block platelets\">\n      <div class=\"line heading\">4. 血小板　(1)特点：形状不规则、无细胞核、很小</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2\">直径约 2－4 μm，体积仅相当于红细胞的 1/3，是血液中最小的有形成分</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">(2)数量：正常成人10万－30万个/mm<sup>3</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">(3)功能：<span class=\"blue\">加速血液凝固，防止大量出血和阻止细菌入侵</span></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"block changes\">\n      <div class=\"line heading\">5. 人体血细胞数量变化及症状</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">红细胞　若数目<span class=\"blue\">过少</span>，就是贫血</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">白细胞　若数目<span class=\"blue\">增多</span>，就是身体有炎症</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">血小板　若数目<span class=\"blue\">减少</span>，不能凝血</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"block lifespan\">\n      <div class=\"line heading\">6. 血细胞的寿命</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1 smaller\">血细胞都有一定的寿命。红细胞寿命约为120天，大约60天后红细胞衰老一半，红骨髓具有造</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-heading\">7. 血液的功能</div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
